 had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must have ``role``'s admin role. May emit a {RoleRevoked} event."},"supportsInterface(bytes4)":{"details":"Returns true if this contract implements the interface defined by `interfaceId`. See the corresponding https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-165#how-interfaces-are-identified[ERC section] to learn more about how these ids are created. This function call must use less than 30 000 gas."},"unpause()":{"details":"Unpauses the contract"},"unregisterVault(address,address)":{"details":"Revokes the registration of a vault address"},"upgradeToAndCall(address,bytes)":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow-reachable":"delegatecall","details":"Upgrade the implementation of the proxy to `newImplementation`, and subsequently execute the function call encoded in `data`. Calls {_authorizeUpgrade}. Emits an {Upgraded} event."}},"stateVariables":{"REGISTER_TYPEHASH":{"details":"EIP-712 typehash for the RegisterVault struct"},"_operatorNonces":{"details":"Per-investor, per-operator nonces for EIP-712 signature invalidation"},"token":{"details":"The token address this vault registrar is associated with"}},"title":"VaultRegistrar","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"InvalidAddress()":[{"notice":"Thrown when an invalid address (zero address) is provided"}],"InvalidInvestorSignature()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the investor signature is invalid or does not match"}],"InvestorNotFound(address)":[{"notice":"Thrown when an investor is not found for a wallet"}],"NotAnOperator(address)":[{"notice":"Thrown when invalidateOperatorPermission is called for an address that does not hold OPERATOR_ROLE"}],"NotImplemented()":[{"notice":"Thrown when a function is not implemented"}],"SignatureExpired()":[{"notice":"Thrown when the signature deadline has passed"}],"VaultAlreadyRegistered(address)":[{"notice":"Thrown when a vault is already registered"}],"VaultBelongsToDifferentInvestor(address,string)":[{"notice":"Thrown when a va